{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gzPBByAU8_uCF0KHsCnzlQ?scene=1&click_id=14","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:06.779830+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gzPBByAU8_uCF0KHsCnzlQ?scene=1&click_id=14","html":"<div><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2p6LDmWgmaFUeSQ6y3nyJXTCNglicMIc9BKJTGqNRYtiazqnwU6bmrd8E0bl8BE1WStx6wuYS26fDkvBORrHbglg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\" title=\"校徽.jpg\"/></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2p6LDmWgmaHLUFkfhwDiaZPqoHAr3eLhkpfkicv9GvYEa6sAUlVn2WUwBRw4WUBm3gRzrcvmu9p3QzeOiaicOkpNSQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><p><span><span><span>学在江财，金融伴你成才！</span></span></span></p></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2p6LDmWgmaHLUFkfhwDiaZPqoHAr3eLhkhpAmLcndIbnNO2IYHUarJX96uEXqiaHpZYb9KI92JAkNIPsQjgeP8QQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>申请对象</span></b></font></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>2、已获得或预计能获得所在高校2025年推荐免试攻读硕士研究生资格的全国大学优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>3、在校期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></p><p><span>4、诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>5、申请人员具有突出的科研能力与潜质，原则上具有良好的英语应用能力与较好的经济学、数学训练。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>申请材料</span></b></font></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、简历1份。</span></p><p><span>2、本科阶段成绩单1份。</span></p><p><span>3、能够体现自身英语水平的证件复印件1份（如CET-4、CET-6、IELTS、TOEFL等证书）。</span></p><p><span>4、申请人还可提交获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作效果等材料复印件。</span></p><p><span>请将上述证明材料制成PDF格式后，压缩成一个zip格式文件并注明</span><span><span>“姓名-本科学校-申请专业-手机号码”</span></span><span>后发到指定邮箱。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>申请办法</span></b></font></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、提交申请材料</span></p><p><span>有意者请于2025年9月20日前将上述要求的电子材料提交到专用邮箱：497693628@qq.com</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0791-83802306</span></p><p><span>2、资格初审</span></p><p><span>学院研究生招生领导小组对申请进行初审，确认是否接收申请，并请申请者提供准确联系信息，届时学院将通知初审合格的申请者参加复试。</span></p><p><span>3、复试</span></p><p><span>复试采取线上专业面试的方式进行（2025年度江财优秀大学生夏令营优秀营员免面试）。</span></p><p><span>4、考生身体状况应符合国家规定的体检标准（同普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见）。</span></p><p><span>5、接受的专业为</span><span><span>金融学、金融硕士（含金融科技方向）、保险硕士</span></span><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>奖学金体系</span></b></font></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>全日制硕士研究生奖助体系包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、优秀奖学金、单项奖学金、“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>注意事项</span></b></font></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、报名阶段，接受时间从即日起至9月20日止，请有意者尽早报名。</span></p><p><span>2、请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式、联系邮箱，以免错失机会。</span></p><p><span>3、申请人必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。我院将对拟录取的推荐免试研究生张榜公示，如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消其录取资格或取消其学籍。</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>金融学院</span></p><p><span>2025年9月10日</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/2p6LDmWgmaF0ct4TiahwKyhNLZ49PoM35haiaic6WKAR6xgTMOdjjYRJZeeqmVibDbKmVP3kScEyhh05ml2kaXjDjw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span>-END-</span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/2p6LDmWgmaF0ct4TiahwKyhNLZ49PoM35Abmb1iapcbjpzkEibalMtH3OEtf7RfEye5YQ0KGknkX50E51HpHM2OEw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>图文/金融学院</span></p><p><span>编辑/胡家颖</span></p><p><span>学生审核人/胡家颖</span></p><p><span>单位审核人/王琪 廖春妍 万鹏</span></p></section></section><p><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/f4cde2624e3117c69826.webp\"/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"fece57cefe9ce64a838beaca117da01c3c8c00f0567f21080a36edca101f0855","textLength":966,"sourceSha256":"4f4e94faf49c93122f3086f2c453efdb75cfe231c486a36bcf8c5aac7be71f06","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e6b69fca4e3f1a7a582b","title":"2025年江西财经大学金融学院关于接收2026年研究生推免生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:06.779830+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2p6LDmWgmaFIjeZNbBqclIrCPM5BX7QTKhd4bOR0VKgVab3uXDxmpibcaHDfUWbpNXvpdbM4CtKSiaxkRmGcjdgA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&tp=webp&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1","file":"assets/articles/media/f4cde2624e3117c69826.webp"}]}
